  "instructions": [
    "Season the pilchards with salt and black pepper.",
    "Sear the pilchards in a pan with a little oil until browned on both sides.",
    "Add the diced onion and minced garlic to the pan and cook until the onion is translucent.",
    "Add the diced tomatoes and tomato sauce to the pan and stir to combine.",
    "Return the pilchards to the pan and simmer in the sauce for a few minutes.",
    "Use a sous vide machine to cook the pilchards in a water bath at 130°C (266°F) for 30 minutes.",
    "Check the pilchards for doneness and remove them from the water bath.",
    "Serve the pilchards hot with the sauce spooned over the top."
